#: discover/DiscoverObject.cpp:197
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title %1 is the name"
msgid ""
"%1 is not configured for installing apps through Discover—only app add-ons"
msgstr ""
"Distribucija %1 nije podešena za instaliranje programa kroz Otkrivač, samo "
"dodataka programa"

#: discover/DiscoverObject.cpp:199
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip %2 is the name of the operating system"
msgid ""
"To use Discover for apps, install your preferred module on the "
"<interface>Settings</interface> page, under <interface>Missing Backends</"
"interface>.<nl/><nl/>Please <link url='%1'>report this issue to %2.</link>"
msgstr ""
"Da biste Otkrivač koristili za programe, instalirajte željeni modul na "
"stranici <interface>Postavke</interface>, pod <interface>Nedostajuće "
"pozadine</interface>.<nl/><nl/><link url='%1'>Prijavite ovaj problem "
"distribuciji %2.</link>"

#: discover/DiscoverObject.cpp:206
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt ""
"@info:usagetip %1 is the distro name; in this case it always contains 'Arch "
"Linux'"
msgid ""
"To use Discover for apps, install <link url='https://wiki.archlinux.org/"
"title/Flatpak#Installation'>Flatpak</link> using the <command>pacman</"
"command> package manager.<nl/><nl/> Review <link url='https://archlinux.org/"
"packages/extra/x86_64/discover/'>%1's packaging for Discover</link>"
msgstr ""
"Da biste Otkrivač koristili za programe, instalirajte <link url='https://"
"wiki.archlinux.org/title/Flatpak#Installation'>Flatpak</link> menadžerom "
"paketa <command>pacman</command>.<nl/><nl/> Pogledajte <link url='https://"
"archlinux.org/packages/extra/x86_64/discover/'>pakovanje Otkrivača u "
"distribuciji %1</link>"

#: discover/DiscoverObject.cpp:216
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip %1 is the distro name"
msgid ""
"Support for managing packages from %1 is incomplete; you may experience any "
"number of problems. Do not report bugs to KDE. It is highly recommended to "
"uninstall the <resource>packagekit-qt6</resource> package and use Discover "
"only to manage Flatpaks, Snaps, and Add-Ons.<para>%1 maintainers recommended "
"instead using the <command>pacman</command> command-line tool to manage "
"packages.</para>"
msgstr ""
"Podrška za upravljanje paketima iz distribucije %1 nije potpuna; možete "
"naići na razne probleme. Ne prijavljujte greške KDE‑u. Izričito se "
"preporučuje da deinstalirate paket <resource>packagekit-qt6</resource> i "
"Otkrivač koristite samo za upravljanje dodacima i Flatpak i snap paketima."
"<para>Održavaoci distribucije %1 preporučuju da se umesto toga paketima "
"upravlja alatkom komandne linije <command>pacman</command>.</para>"

